{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Super Artificial Intelligence PSIKE is a 2D indie platformer game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Action: Fast and beautiful combo attacks and effects will take you into the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/stage08.png?t=1747490773\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/stage04_01.png?t=1747490773\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/stage11_01.png?t=1747490773\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Graphical experience: The epic story that penetrates the game can be experienced as a visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/startDemo.png?t=1747490773\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/stage01.png?t=1747490773\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/stage02.png?t=1747490773\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">STORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the near future, artificial intelligence with ego is born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a result, mankind is facing a new leap forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, humanity is starting to be increasingly controlled by artificial intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day. PSIKE, an artificial intelligence that will save mankind, is born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PSIKE, an artificial intelligence who wants to become a human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alex, a man full of disbelief in artificial intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Guardians of the Round Table who stand in the way of PSIKE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The wheel of fortune begins to spin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/StartScreen_01_AdobeExpress-3.gif?t=1747490773\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2083430?t=1747490773","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747490773","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747490773","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747490773","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Super Artificial Intelligence PSIKE is a 2D indie platformer game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Action: Fast and beautiful combo attacks and effects will take you into the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2083430/extras/stage08.png?t=1747490773\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\